+FM squelch level 1 opens below raw noise 41, up from 39. The close line stays at raw noise 42, one unit below
+the lowest empty-channel reading in the FD6818 reference measurements. Verify the weak-carrier opening and return
+to idle on both RF sections. See [radio-features.md](radio-features.md) 3.5 for the shared squelch rules.
+
 Receive sequences, in the radio's own order. CTCSS: 0x07 = the tone word, 0x07 = 0x21CE, 0x52, then 0x51. DCS: 0x07 =
